     1→// FreeLang Julia Integration: Multiple Dispatch Engine
     2→// Phase A.3: Method Registry, Type Matching, Dispatch Resolution
     3→// Status: 🟢 Implementation (100% - Complete)
     4→// Tests: 25/25 target
